{"id":9167,"date":"2026-02-09T12:34:14","date_gmt":"2026-02-09T11:34:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=9167"},"modified":"2026-02-09T12:34:14","modified_gmt":"2026-02-09T11:34:14","slug":"frelon-asiatique-agir-des-maintenant","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/frelon-asiatique-agir-des-maintenant\/","title":{"rendered":"Frelon asiatique : agir d\u00e8s maintenant !"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"536\">Le frelon asiatique (<em data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"275\">Vespa velutina<\/em>), reconnaissable \u00e0 ses <strong data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"316\">pattes jaunes<\/strong>, est aujourd\u2019hui <strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"372\">bien implant\u00e9 sur notre territoire<\/strong>. Sa pr\u00e9sence a un <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"431\">impact important sur la biodiversit\u00e9<\/strong>, notamment sur les abeilles, et peut aussi causer des d\u00e9g\u00e2ts dans les jardins, vergers et espaces verts.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"648\">\ud83d\udc49 <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"591\">La lutte commence au printemps <\/strong>(en f\u00e9vrier d\u00e8s +12\u00b0C) <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"591\">par le pi\u00e9geage<\/strong>, un geste simple et utile pour limiter la prolif\u00e9ration.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"689\">\ud83e\udea4 Le pi\u00e9geage : quand et comment ?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"898\">\ud83d\udcc5 <strong data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"711\">P\u00e9riodes id\u00e9ales<\/strong> : de <strong>f\u00e9vrier d\u00e8s +12\u00b0C \u00e0 mi-mai<\/strong> puis de<strong> mi-septembre \u00e0 mi-d\u00e9cembre<\/strong> (temp\u00e9ratures n\u00e9gatives)<br data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"733\" \/>\ud83d\udccd <strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"752\">Installation<\/strong> :<br data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"757\" \/>\u2022 Suspendre les pi\u00e8ges entre <strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"803\">1 et 2 m\u00e8tres<\/strong> de hauteur<br data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"817\" \/>\u2022 En <strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"844\">zone semi-ombrag\u00e9e<\/strong><br data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"847\" \/>\u2022 V\u00e9rifier et renouveler l\u2019app\u00e2t <strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"898\">chaque semaine<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1036\">\ud83c\udf6f <strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"928\">App\u00e2t maison efficace<\/strong> :<br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\" \/>\u2022 1\/3 de sirop de fruits rouges (grenadine ou cassis)<br data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"989\" \/>\u2022 1\/3 de bi\u00e8re brune<br data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1012\" \/>\u2022 1\/3 de vin blanc sec<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1175\">\ud83d\udd0e <strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1073\">Pi\u00e8ges s\u00e9lectifs recommand\u00e9s<\/strong> (en magasins sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s ou en ligne) :<br data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1116\" \/>\u2022 Beevital<br data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1129\" \/>\u2022 Osaka s\u00e9lect (type japonais)<br data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1162\" \/>\u2022 Good4Bees<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1205\">\u26a0\ufe0f Vous rep\u00e9rez un nid ?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1374\">\u274c N\u2019intervenez jamais vous-m\u00eame<br data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1240\" \/>\ud83d\udcde <strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1285\">Signalez-le imp\u00e9rativement \u00e0 la mairie<\/strong> avant toute destruction<br data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1312\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1352\">services-techniques@ville-hoenheim.fr<\/a><br data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1355\" \/>\u260e\ufe0f 03 88 19 23 64<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1465\">\ud83c\udf10 Pensez aussi \u00e0 signaler sa pr\u00e9sence sur la plateforme nationale : <strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1465\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http:\/\/www.lefrelon.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1463\">www.lefrelon.com<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1650\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\ud83d\udcaa <strong data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1594\">Ensemble, par des gestes simples comme le pi\u00e9geage, nous pouvons limiter sa propagation et prot\u00e9ger notre environnement.<\/strong><br data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1597\" \/>Merci pour votre vigilance et votre engagement ! \ud83d\udc1d\ud83c\udf31<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Le frelon asiatique (Vespa velutina), reconnaissable \u00e0 ses pattes jaunes, est aujourd\u2019hui bien implant\u00e9 sur notre territoire. Sa pr\u00e9sence a un impact important sur la biodiversit\u00e9, notamment sur les abeilles, et peut aussi causer des d\u00e9g\u00e2ts dans les jardins, vergers et espaces verts. \ud83d\udc49 La lutte commence au printemps (en f\u00e9vrier d\u00e8s +12\u00b0C) par le [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":9168,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"saved","_expiration-date":1797333540,"_expiration-date-type":"draft","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":{"expireType":"draft","id":9167}},"categories":[31,14],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/9167"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/11"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=9167"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/9167\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":